gory":"Venues & Event Spaces","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ok5XP4P33_6qNo5uMO3vxQ","review_id":"weMycNecBU__RlsrZ1N3Kw","date":"2021-01-31T10:53:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9178889393806458,"text_excerpt":"Super fun! These selfie galleries are popping up all over but this one truly stood out. There was no tour guide here. Just buy your ticket for your time slot and move about the gallery at your own pace. There are hooks for your belongings and hand sanitizer everywhere. Social distancing is encouraged. They offer you a free selfie stick/ tripod to use. I'm pretty sure you can pay extra for a photograph too. The back grounds will also be changed out every so often, I'm excited to see what's your come."},{"business_id":"Ok5XP4P33_6qNo5uMO3vxQ","review_id":"ZXYNdwblLYhOJdmZRIca2w","date":"2020-12-22T04:30:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156663417816162,"text_excerpt":"This selfie gallery was way better than expected. I thought I was only going to take about 30 minutes in there but it ended up being an hour. They provide you with a free selfie stick to borrow during your trip, but I strongly recommend you go with someone for better angles and dope pictures. It was fun and interactive when you are with someone but going alone might have a different experience as we all are a bit shy taking pictures of ourselves in public. I had a lot of fun and would recommend everyone should tour this gallery. I received a ticket as a Yelp Elite Perk"},{"business_id":"Ok5XP4P33_6qNo5uMO3vxQ","review_id":"njpdQI-K-G0M68xMCJEGnA","date":"2020-12-20T23:30:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9139683246612549,"text_excerpt":"I went to ARTMazing this past December. They had lots of backdrops to take photos. My favorite was the pink plastic ball room and the LED light room. The people working there were very friendly and helped take some couple shots as well. Because it was around the holidays there were spots for holiday photo shoots like a Christmas tree. If you like taking photos even with a friend, then this is the place for you!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
